<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
<style>
  body { margin:0; padding:0; background:#FAFAF8; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif; }
  .wrap { max-width:560px; margin:32px auto; background:#fff; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid #E8E4DF; }
  .hero { background:#F0FDF4; padding:36px 32px 28px; text-align:center; border-bottom:1px solid #BBF7D0; }
  .emoji { font-size:48px; line-height:1; margin-bottom:12px; }
  h1 { margin:0 0 8px; font-size:22px; font-weight:700; color:#15803D; }
  .sub { margin:0; font-size:14px; color:#6B7280; }
  .body { padding:28px 32px; }
  .credit-box { background:#F0FDF4; border:1px solid #BBF7D0; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; text-align:center; margin:20px 0; }
  .credit-amt { font-size:40px; font-weight:800; color:#16A34A; }
  .credit-label { font-size:13px; color:#6B7280; margin-top:4px; }
  .expire-note { font-size:12px; color:#9CA3AF; margin-top:8px; }
  .cta { display:block; margin:24px 0 0; padding:14px 28px; background:#16A34A; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:10px; font-weight:700; font-size:15px; text-align:center; }
  .footer { background:#FAFAF8; padding:16px 32px; text-align:center; font-size:11px; color:#9CA3AF; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="emoji">🎉</div>
    <h1>Your friend just bought!</h1>
    <p class="sub">Hi {{firstName}}, your referral worked — here's your reward.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="body">
    <p style="font-size:14px;color:#374151;margin:0 0 20px">Someone clicked your referral link and placed an order. As promised, your store credit has been added automatically.</p>
    <div class="credit-box">
      <div class="credit-amt">${{creditAmount}}</div>
      <div class="credit-label">store credit added to your account</div>
      <div class="expire-note">Expires {{expiresAt}}</div>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:#374151;margin:16px 0">Your credit will be applied automatically at checkout on your next order — no coupon needed.</p>
    <a href="https://mapleloom.com/products" class="cta">Shop now &amp; use your credit →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">© {{year}} MapleLoom Handmade · Credit is non-transferable and cannot be cashed out.</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
